    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakelo piŵayiweni kuti ngakumŵelecela Yakobo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵanace, ŵamtendele litima Leya mkulugwawo jula, nipo ŵamsalile Yakobo kuti, “Mumbe ŵanace, naga ngamkumba, kuli cenene kuti une mbwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maloŵe gelega gampwetesye mtima Yakobo, ni ŵatite kwa Lakelo, “Mkanjimba une magambo, une ngaŵa Mlungu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakelo ni ŵatite kwa Yakobo, “Mumjigale Biliha jwamasengo jwanguju, mtame najo malo gamo kuti ambelecele une mwanace, kuti kupitila mwa jwalakweju none jwakwe ngole ŵanace.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Lakelo ŵampelece Biliha kwa ŵamkwakwe, nipo Yakobo ŵatemi najo malo gamo Bilihajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliha ŵakwete citumbo ni ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwamlume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakelo ŵatite kuti, “Mlungu alamwile mwakusalalila une mtima. Alipikene lipopelo lyangu, nipo ambele une mwanace jwamlume.” Myoyo mwanacejo ŵampele lina lyakwe Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliha jwamasengo jwa Lakelo jula ŵakwete soni citumbo cine, ni ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwamlume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakelo ŵatite, “Limbene nawo kwakukulungwa mnope cemwali, nambo sambano mbundile.” Myoyo mwanace jula ŵampele lina lyakuti Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ali ayiweni kuti alesile kuŵeleka, ŵamjigele Silipa jwamasengo jwakwe ni kumpeleka kwa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Silipa ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwamlume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ni ŵatite, “Ngwete upile!” Ni ŵampele mwanacejo lina lyakwe Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silipa jwamasengo jwa Leya jula ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwine jwamlume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ŵatite, “Mbundile kondwa. Acakongwe tandende une kuti jwamjaliwe.” Myoyo ŵampele mwanace jula lina lyakwe Asha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line, ndaŵi jakata tiligu, Lubeni ŵapite ku migunda kuŵawusimene mtela wakusyana mundu kuti aŵelece, ŵayice nawo kwa Leya mama ŵawo. Nipo Lakelo ŵatite kwa Leya, “Conde mungaŵile une panandi mtela wawuŵelesi wamjigalile mwanagwenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Leya ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana ŵamkwangu ŵamusumwile ŵala nginakwana? Lelo soni mkusaka musumule mtela wakusyana wanjigalile mwanangu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakelo ni ŵatite, “Naga mkungaŵila une mtela wakusyanawo, ŵalumeŵa tagone kumangwenu cilo cino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo piŵawujaga kutyocela ku migunda ligulo, Leya ŵajile kukwacingamila ni ŵasalile kuti, “Lelo agone ku nyumba jangu kuno, pakuŵa nimlipilile kala mtela wa kusyana.” Myoyo Yakobo ŵagonile ni Leya cele ciloco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵalipikene lipopelo lya Leya, nipo Leya ŵakwete citumbo cine, ni ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwamsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ni ŵatite, “Mlungu andipile ligongo nampelece jwamasengo jwangu kwa ŵamkwangu.” Myoyo mwanacejo ŵampele lina lyakwe Isakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ŵakwete citumbo cine soni, ni ŵamŵelecele Yakobo mwanace jwamsano ni jumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ŵatite kuti, “Mlungu ambele une mtuka wakusalala. Sambano ŵamkwangu tanjimbicisyeje ligongo naŵelecele ŵanace ŵacalume msano ni jumo.” Myoyo mwanace jula ŵampele lina lyakwe Sebuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵaŵelece mwanace jwamkongwe nipo ŵampele lina lyakwe Dina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵamtendele canasa Lakelo, pakulipikana lipopelo lyakwe ni ŵamkundile kuti aŵelece ŵanace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakwete citumbo ni ŵaŵelece mwanace jwamlume. Lakelo ŵatite, “Mlungu andyosisye soni sya ungaŵeleka wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵampele lina lyakwe Yosefe, pakuŵa ŵatite kuti, “AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ambe soni une jwine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
